  "title": "NSIS: remove link to not secure winpcap.org",
  "description": "Closes #16151  \nScreenshots of Firefox and Chrome warnings attached to #16151  \nThe web site does support https with a valid cert.  \nBased on this [Winpcap-announce](https://www.winpcap.org/pipermail/winpcap-announce/2018-November/000032.html) the web site may not get much updating going forward?  \n  \nMake an intervention and send the user to the Wireshark wiki where they can read pros/cons of Npcap vs WinPcap.  \nIf still need to install WinPcap, there is a link to the site on the Wiki page.",
